{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Creat !it! Wallpaper Maker 可讓用家把鎖屏變成可創作的動態拼貼，加入貼紙、相片與文字，適合喜歡自訂手機外觀的人。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-201.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>親手拼貼動態鎖屏</h2>\n<p>用家可把貼紙、相片與文字放到鎖屏畫布，拖曳、縮放、旋轉及長按複製即可完成拼貼；再以 Calm 至 Wild 調校動態，加入視差與路徑，匯出 Live Photo 或 MP4。程式內建數千款貼紙、圖形、背景與相框，亦可一鍵提取相片主體，作品不含水印。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-226-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-227-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-228-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-229-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Creat !it! Wallpaper Maker</li><li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/creat-it-wallpaper-maker/id6809227034?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T00:49:43.740191+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":291,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T00:40:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T15:33:31.853715+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T00:43:11.880174+00:00","content_hash":"8ef14a8547b55bfebb1dd667d18672dedf15854cfeef9d104d0db30766f46699","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}